Sat Oct 24 19:38:04 UTC 2026 - Martin Pluskal <mpluskal@suse.com>

- Update to version 4.0.5 (major release, 3.x -> 4.x):
  * Upstream repository moved from Praqma to mkubaczyk; the
    container image is now published as ghcr.io/mkubaczyk/helmsman
  * Support both Helm 3.x and Helm 4.x
  * Add option to verify charts before using them
  * Create namespaces with labels and annotations in a single
    request
  * Fix helm diff --dry-run handling under Helm 4 and AWS
    credential error propagation
  * Require Go >= 1.24 to build
  * helmsman is not affected by CVE-2026-41178 (boo#1276641):
    shipped go.opentelemetry.io/otel is 1.38.0 while only 1.41.0
    and 1.43.0 carry the flaw

